Package: cliff
Title: Gynecologic Surgical Subspecialty Workforce Cliff Analysis
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Tyler", "Muffly", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tyler.muffly@dhha.org")
Description: Reproducible analysis and manuscript for near-term fellowship-completion
    versus clinical-practice-departure balance in gynecologic oncology and
    urogynecology (2025-2029). Extracted from the isochrones monorepo.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    bit64, blme, broom, bslib, checkmate, chromote, data.table, DBI, digest,
    dplyr, DT, duckdb, eulerr, flextable, forcats, ggplot2, glue, gtsummary,
    here, hms, htmlwidgets, httr, humaniformat, janitor, jsonlite, kableExtra,
    knitr, leaflet, lme4, lubridate, maps, mufflyaccess, officer, optparse, patchwork, plotly,
    purrr, RcppRoll, readr, readxl, rlang, rmarkdown, rsconnect, scales, sf,
    shiny, shinydashboard, shinytest2, stringr, testthat, tibble, tidycensus,
    tidygeocoder, tidyr, tidyverse, tigris, usethis, viridis, withr, yaml, zipangu
Suggests:
    arrow,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Remotes:
    mufflyt/mufflyaccess
Note: 'exploratory' (Exploratory.io, non-CRAN) is used by one legacy script and
    is intentionally omitted from Imports; install separately if that script is run.
    mufflyaccess (mufflyt/mufflyaccess, GitHub) is the canonical URPS SSOT per
    docs/CHARTER_cliff.md; cliff consumes it via R/urps_baseline.R and never derives
    the national baseline itself.
